{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5a29f2643ffd3583f22b287245ca2b722f394e728c87d11de6db52debea8ffa3", "ja": "（『ミリオンスターズラジオ』宛のおたよりも増えて\nきたが、星梨花は今も一枚一枚、丁寧に読んでいる）", "zh": "（寄给《百万明星广播》的来信越来越多了，但星梨花现在依然会一封一封地认真阅读）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1001_p", "source_sha256": "274bc9c549f9167b8d5b5d228eed7f36d924f56e7ce7f483bd21cb4d3b3e16f5", "ja": "お疲れ様、星梨花。\nおたよりを読むの、大変じゃないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，星梨花。\n读来信很辛苦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "15c16d836e07034822c8d73ec3c956b5815d1bca176beb304ab8df092e6db990", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　大変じゃない\nですよ。おたよりを読むの、とっても楽しいです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！不辛苦哦。读大家的来信特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "7c483e78f6f9059dc58736066aed764166f5bb7e592fd4c028e8cd4a0a3ef3e3", "ja": "みなさんがラジオを楽しんでくれてることも、\nたくさん伝わってきて、うれしくなりますし。", "zh": "也能充分感受到大家听广播听得很开心，\n我心里也觉得好高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "40c80b9b0662b824425ee6b9a75cacb51b05c84f6dbe1493d282267984a1ae13", "ja": "未来さん静香さんだけじゃなくて、リスナーの\nみなさんともおしゃべりしてる気持ちになります♪", "zh": "不只是未来和静香，也让我觉得自己像是在和各位听众聊天♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7f38d6fc4916a7b3f98a781fab8c37fe7255c254f7d3a1b6f15e6fd59fa31be1", "ja": "なるほど。きっと聞いてくれてる人たちも、\n星梨花と同じように感じてくれてるんだろうな。", "zh": "原来如此。愿意收听的大家，一定也和星梨花有着同样的感受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "148100f23d37381591343c36376a64d18cc18fc137df447903ccfb24c80dfbac", "ja": "えへへ、そうかもしれません。どのおたよりも、\nおしゃべりみたいな感じで書いてくれていて……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，说不定真的是这样。每封来信都写得像是在聊天一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "82d86efdce579523f52cde6ec29a14ac2955b758a1e5b10970b21a4f36a23c97", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さん。お仕事なのに、\nおしゃべりを楽しんじゃっていいんでしょうか？", "zh": "不过，{$P$}先生。明明是在工作，却可以享受聊天吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1008_p", "source_sha256": "244b68cc0ad1269a982218d61472fb71229df4f33fe35f69d5a8fe4afabc6db4", "ja": "もちろん。ラジオっていうのは、\n基本そういうものだから。", "zh": "当然可以。因为广播这种形式，\n基本上就是这样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "182fd2a29da3328f71a093290798195124e0087f1d839f67a790bfca120bf7db", "ja": "そうなんですか……。わたし、じつはラジオのこと、\nぜんぜん知らなかったんです。", "zh": "是这样吗……其实我对广播，一点都不了解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "c026ceee05a2743a14328aa175b1f4f16bdea60349f34c71d9ef5202495d064d", "ja": "はじめて聞いたときは、テレビが壊れてるから\n声しか聞こえないのかな、って思ってて……。", "zh": "第一次听到的时候，我还以为是电视坏了，所以才只能听到声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b7176f6e83bf7f1180fccf3949628c6266518236f5e50e3c502823d5f03391eb", "ja": "そ、そうか……。でも、たしかに最近はみんな、\nラジオに触れる機会が減ってるみたいなんだ。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……不过，确实感觉最近大家接触收音机的机会都变少了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "40a113b0874ac1f5599a18bc4a5ebbdb232e21b693e7c40144166b222468bc0b", "ja": "そうなんですか？　それは……もったいないです！\nラジオって、こんなにステキなのに。", "zh": "是这样吗？那可真是……太可惜了！\n广播明明这么棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "b9eec544df2653b54b1d70dc09ff150696c268718c41b435bfce107362b695ba", "ja": "それじゃ、ラジオをもっと聞いてもらえるように。\nあ、わたし達の番組だけじゃなくて。", "zh": "那为了让大家能多听听广播。\n啊，不只是我们的节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "5fd76435b34946ea604ac14501738cefd5a8ffa39b48158186d1f993d44ce8c9", "ja": "ラジオって楽しいんだって思って、いろいろ\nたくさん聞いてもらえるように、頑張りますね！", "zh": "我会努力让大家觉得广播很有趣，这样就能多听各种各样的节目！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9af59136b84b0e2785efbedd641e505a7007e010c95ab1f60e693ce32b6d5252", "ja": "うん、そうだな。これからもたくさん、\n楽しいおしゃべりを届けて、盛り上げていこう！", "zh": "嗯，说得对。今后也多多传递\n欢快的畅谈，把气氛炒热起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "58b91dd00295a6a6c5c6a647be20abc0bdb389b0f2e635d443642f1665e92e29", "ja": "はい！　ときどき、みなさんに聞かれるのが\nはずかしいお話になったりもしますけど……。", "zh": "好的！有时候也会变成让大家听了觉得害羞的话题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0623_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "ea37d96cbef22eff5b21e846f843a829f298b023c415dfbcc9877e254ea17b1f", "ja": "でも、そういうお話でも楽しいって言ってもらえると\nうれしいですから。これからも頑張ります♪", "zh": "不过，即使是那样的话题，只要大家愿意说很开心，我也会很高兴的。所以今后也会继续努力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
